  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nMorphos is a psychological horror/adventure game in which you play as a man who has recently been discharged from a psychiatric hospital after losing his memory.<p></p>\n<p>Upon returning home, your wife, a research scientist, out of compassion and a desire to keep an eye on you, arranges for you to join her team. Your workplace turns out to be a gloomy and mysterious underground complex where experiments with anomalous phenomena are conducted.</p>\n<p>At first, everything seems like an attempt to return to normal life, but soon strange things begin to happen underground.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exploration of a gloomy underground complex.\n</li><li>Solving numerous puzzles.\n</li><li>Dynamic dialogue with response choices.\n</li><li>Shifting level geometry (mazes, spatial distortions).\n</li><li>Hidden jump scares and sudden frightening events.\n</li><li>Various types of environmental traps.\n</li><li>Encounters with monsters and anomalies.\n</li><li>Multiple weapon types for self-defense.\n</li><li>Stealth movement.\n</li><li>Finding keys and artifacts for progression.\n</li><li>Final boss battle with a highly dangerous boss.\n</li><li>Resource management (health, ammo).\n</li><li>Save system in safe rooms.\n</li><li>Temporal anomalies affecting gameplay.\n</li></ul>\n",
